WEBVTT

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:25.120
The suspect Jack Atlas escaped last night, 
and his current whereabouts are unknown.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.740
Security has increased their highway patrols.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.980
They're warning citizens 
against using the highways.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.880
Where did Jack go?

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:42.460
Yusei and Crow, didn't 
you meet Jack yesterday?

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:44.350
Yes, but...

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.030
Jack, what's going on?

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:57.600
Editor, Jack is innocent!

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:01.870
He probably escaped because he 
wants to clear his name personally!

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.190
I don't care about your theories!

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:08.580
If you don't rewrite the article into 
something the public will accept, I'll fire you!

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.350
I've had enough!

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.050
If you want to fire me, go ahead!

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:21.560
I'll prove that Jack is innocent!

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:46.310
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:51.850
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:56.430
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:56.430 --> 00:02:02.100
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:07.130
There's no need to fear

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:14.780
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:20.910
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:26.550
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:32.140
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:40.070
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:12.160
Another Jack

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:15.790
Is that true?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:16.750
Are you sure?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.340
Yeah, it's true.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:22.110
See?  There's no doubt!

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:25.760
They're both Jack Atlas' D-Wheels.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.310
They were driving very recklessly!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:31.780
Why are there two of them?

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.250
What?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.930
Two Wheel of Fortunes?

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:38.910
There's only one Wheel 
of Fortune in the world.

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.710
The D-Wheel only belongs to Jack.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.050
Since there were two...

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:50.670
The Jack we saw was a fake!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.900
Then where's the real Jack?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.240
Crow!

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.390
It's...

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.130
That's Trust Guardian.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.150
Jack fell into the ocean!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:31.220
Damn!  How could I say those things to him?

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:32.610
Jack!

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.110
Jack!

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:39.440
Jack...

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.380
Big trouble!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:44.990
What is it?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:48.100
Jack appeared on the highway again!

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:59.400
Who are you?

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.900
Why are you pretending to be me?

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.650
I only have one thing to say to you.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:08.140
In your current state, you'll never beat me!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:18.750
Jack, why are you doing this?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.960
Where's your pride as a D-Wheeler?

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.270
Jack, don't commit any more crimes!

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:47.280
You'll remember how it felt when the King 
provided entertainment by crushing everyone!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.590
What are you planning?  Stop it!

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.760
Jose, did you overestimate him?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:00.730
He already lost to a phony.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.720
He has the power of the Crimson Dragon.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:09.660
If he's cornered, he'll 
make the Circuit appear.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:11.050
I'm counting on you.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:14.210
It was difficult to copy his card.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.910
Stop!

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:23.380
Yusei!  Crow!

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:26.620
How dare you kill Jack!

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:28.700
He killed Jack?

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.330
What do you mean?

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.360
That Jack is a fake!

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:33.090
What?

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.340
What a funny thing to say!

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.360
I'm the real Jack Atlas!

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.070
Whatever!  You're not Jack!

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:46.810
Jack is arrogant, selfish 
and a gigantic idiot!

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:51.390
But he's a dear friend 
who battled alongside us!

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:54.850
But I didn't believe him!

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:56.890
Crow...

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:00.680
I have to apologize to him!

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:04.150
That's why I'm going to get Jack's revenge!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.120
Go ahead and try!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.130
Crow!

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:16.130
Crow!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:23.480
Pummeling and devouring the weak 
is proof that I'm Jack Atlas!

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:24.300
You're wrong!

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:30.850
If you're the real Jack, you would know that 
true power is caring about your friends!

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:33.200
A King doesn't need that!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:36.820
Being alone means that 
you're standing at the top!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.160
Yusei!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.560
Yusei!

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.000
How dare you!

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:51.700
How dare you hurt my friends!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.470
I'm following the suspect north 
through Center Field District.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.070
There are injured people.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.260
Please provide backup!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.270
Yusei!

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:30.200
I won't let you do whatever 
you want, you phony!

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.120
Jack?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.110
There are two Jacks?

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.550
Jack?  He's alive?

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:44.920
Jack!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:49.290
You really want me to use this.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:57.040
You said that my current self 
can't defeat my former self!

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:03.000
If you're my former self, then I'll show 
you that you can't defeat my current self!

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:05.000
Duel me!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:09.510
Field Spell Speed World 2 set on!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.210
Duel Mode on.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.880
It's this light again.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:19.920
Duel damage becomes real.

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:25.720
Lane selection...

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:28.380
Searching for optimal lane...

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.890
Sending duel lane request to Central.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:33.100
Authorization!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.570
A duel is about to begin.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.560
Normal vehicles must leave 
the route immediately.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.340
A duel is about to begin.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:44.650
Riding Duel!  Acceleration!

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:49.630
My turn!

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.910
I summon Archfiend Interceptor!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.790
I set one card and end my turn!

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:02.130
Entertain this King, pitiful clown!

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.650
You shouldn't be overconfident!

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:06.180
My turn!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.500
Trust Guardian...

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:16.980
If I used this last time, I could've Synchro 
Summoned Red Dragon Archfiend before him.

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:22.680
But my trivial feelings against 
my friends clouded my judgment.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:32.460
When monsters are only on my opponent's 
field, I can Special Summon Vice Dragon!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:38.930
Then I summon the Tuner 
Monster Trust Guardian!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.300
Jack!

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:49.270
Level 3 Trust Guardian 
tunes Level 5 Vice Dragon!

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:54.380
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.810
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:58.280
Synchro Summon!

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:03.560
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.370
I finally caught up!

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.800
All right!  Jack is dueling!

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.240
I got the scoop!

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:31.870
You're not allowed in the duel lane!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.480
Don't be nitpicky!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.720
Battle!  Red Dragon Archfiend 
attacks Archfiend Interceptor!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.190
Absolute Powerforce!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:45.360
Due to Archfiend Interceptor's effect, you 
take 500 points of damage when it's attacked.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:51.130
But Archfiend Interceptor is destroyed!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.500
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.910
My turn!

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:08.170
When monsters are only on your side of the 
field, I can Special Summon Vice Dragon!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.420
It's coming!

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:14.920
Next, I summon the Tuner 
Monster Flare Resonator!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:20.810
Level 3 Flare Resonator 
tunes Level 5 Vice Dragon!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:26.560
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:29.170
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:31.320
Synchro Summon!

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:34.790
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.880
The fake version appeared!

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.610
Two Red Dragon Archfiends?

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:42.580
This is indisputable proof!

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:50.520
Since Flare Resonator was used as Synchro 
Material, my Synchro Monster gains 300 attack points.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.760
His Red Dragon Archfiend 
gained attack points?

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:54.730
Battle!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.960
Absolute Powerforce!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:03.900
But since Trust Guardian was 
used as Synchro Material...

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:07.870
I can lower my Synchro Monster's attack 
points by 400 to negate its destruction!

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.840
I set one card and end my turn!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.690
You decreased Red Dragon Archfiend's 
attack points to avoid destruction?

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:17.100
Coward!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.540
Say whatever you want!

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:21.820
A person who relies too much on 
power will be defeated by power!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.650
My turn!

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:27.210
Battle!  Go, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.430
Erase the fake from the field!

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:33.400
Yours has fewer attack points.

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:35.900
What are you going to show me?

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.640
The Continuous Trap Assault Spirits!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.310
I send a monster with 1000-or-fewer 
attack points to the graveyard.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:46.240
For my turn only, that card's attack 
points are added to Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:48.710
Vanish, fake shadows!

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:52.680
It would normally be mutual 
destruction, but...

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:55.220
That's right!  Trust Guardian's effect!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:59.660
By lowering its attack points by 400, 
my Red Dragon Archfiend isn't destroyed!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.380
I set one card and end my turn!

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.630
Assault Spirits's effect vanishes!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:09.600
That monster is so hurt that it's 
no longer Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:13.100
I'll show you the King's ultimate strategy!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.890
My turn!

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:19.040
When monsters are only on 
your side of the field,

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.540
I can Special Summon Big Piece Golem 
without releasing another monster!

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:26.250
Next, I activate Speed Spell - Angel Baton!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:30.720
I draw two cards from my deck, and then I 
send one card in my hand to the graveyard.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.320
The Continuous Trap Powerful Rebirth!

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:35.790
I Special Summon the Level 4-or-below monster

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:40.360
Small Piece Golem from my graveyard 
and equip it with this card.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:43.800
Due to its effect, its Level 
and attack points increase.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:50.140
When I have both Big and Small Golems, 
I can Special Summon Medium Piece Golem!

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:54.110
Are you going to use Speed Fusion to 
Fusion Summon Multiple Piece Golem?

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:55.380
Don't kid yourself!

00:14:55.380 --> 00:15:01.950
Your trap card Assault Spirits is paid 
as a cost to Special Summon Trap Eater!

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:05.420
A Tuner?

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:11.000
Level 4 Trap Eater tunes 
Level 4 Small Piece Golem!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.680
Synchro Summon!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.660
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:17.600
A second one?

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.890
Since I successfully Synchro Summoned,

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:24.300
I can Special Summon Synchro 
Magnet from my hand!

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:29.210
Synchro Magnet tunes Big Piece Golem!

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:31.780
Then the Continuous Trap Reincarnation Ring!

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.860
By releasing Level 4 Medium Piece Golem,

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:39.020
I can Special Summon a monster from my 
graveyard that has double its Level!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:44.060
Appear, two Red Dragon Archfiends!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.900
He summoned three Red Dragon Archfiends!

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:54.630
No way!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.270
Incredible!

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:56.870
This isn't possible!

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.960
This is unprecedented!

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.340
This is the climax of the 
greatest show on earth!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:08.000
The three Red Dragon Archfiends attacks 
your decaying Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:13.550
Hang in there!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.060
This is the end!

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.760
The third Red Dragon Archfiend attacks!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:27.030
If this attack succeeds, Jack 
will run out of life points!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.040
This is bad!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.340
Don't lose, Jack!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.480
Jack!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:48.690
You activated Ray of Hope 
and halved the damage.

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:52.030
Red Dragon Archfiend, you hung in there!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:55.930
As long as you're around, 
my soul will never break!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.400
Ray of Hope's other effect!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.570
After the end of the Battle Phase,

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:03.870
I Special Summon a Level 
1 monster from my hand!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.600
I Special Summon Dark Bug!

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:09.340
I end my turn.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:13.560
Red Dragon Archfiend withers 
every time it takes an attack,

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:18.160
losing its claws, fangs and desire to battle.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:21.070
That symbolizes your current state!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.080
You're wrong!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:27.320
My previous self was a foolish man 
who only believed in his power!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:31.160
But I now have friends that I can trust!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:35.260
Despite being hurt, Red Dragon 
Archfiend continues to battle,

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:38.990
and Trust Guardian continues to protect it!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.740
That's proof of our bond!

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:42.700
Jack...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:49.140
Since I understand true power, 
I won't yield to my own ghost!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.800
The marks...

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:56.890
They're gathering!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.110
I'm counting on our bond!

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:01.860
Rescue Jack!

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:06.580
I received your bond!

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:13.770
I'll show you the current 
Jack Atlas's true power!

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:15.800
My turn!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.610
Appear, Majestic Dragon!

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:29.440
Let's do this together, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:37.440
Level 1 Majestic Dragon tunes Level 8 Red 
Dragon Archfiend and Level 1 Dark Bug!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.060
The polished superior light!

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:43.740
Illuminate the land as the true ruler!

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:46.200
Shine bright!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.400
Synchro Summon!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:51.840
The great soul Majestic Red Dragon!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.810
What's this glow?

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:56.330
Majestic Red Dragon's monster effect!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:19:01.180
It gains attack points equal to one 
of your monsters until the End Phase!

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.280
Power Gain!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:15.390
7000 attack points?

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:18.460
The evil illusion that confuses the light!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.870
Vanish in the cracks of time!

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.340
Ultimate Powerforce!

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:41.120
This one is also a robot?

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:06.510
Like I thought, that was fruitless.

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:12.150
The copied cards went to waste.

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:20.190
It's the Circuit!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:31.730
Jack!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.140
You did it!

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:38.460
I'll vouch for you that a copycat 
committed all the crimes.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:39.210
Kazama!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:43.450
Jack will be acquitted!

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:46.920
Jack!

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:47.650
Crow...

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:51.000
You're alive?

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:55.620
I guess if you were someone who'd die easily, 
we wouldn't have to go through all this trouble.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:59.580
I said it wasn't me from the start.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:03.100
Come to think of it, weren't 
you going to apologize to me?

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:05.340
How did you know that?

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.580
Is this really the place?

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.810
Yeah.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.330
But everything is gone.

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:24.300
What's up with that robot?

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:29.160
Who created a copycat robot 
to challenge me to a duel?

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:33.260
Since it was a robot, does that 
mean it's the same as Ghost?

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:40.230
It takes incredible skill to copy Red Dragon 
Archfiend and create a robot that looks like Jack.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:44.540
What's happening around us?

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:14.400
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:19.310
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:24.220
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:29.250
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:34.280
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:40.860
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:44.910
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:50.770
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:54.860
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.860 --> 00:23:00.480
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:03.660
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.660 --> 00:23:05.920
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:10.450
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:13.420
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.420 --> 00:23:16.860
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:20.240
At our special place
